---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support" activePage="support">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="page-header-content">
        <div class="page-accent-marks" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="m3"></span>
          <span class="m1"></span>
          <span class="m2"></span>
        </div>
        <h1>Support <span class="title-ckt"><span class="c">C</span><span class="k">K</span><span class="t">T</span></span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="prose wrap">
    <p>
      Got a question about one of our apps, spotted a bug, or want to talk to
      us about a project? We're a small studio, so support goes straight to
      the people who built the thing — not a ticket queue.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <p><strong>Email</strong><br /><a href="mailto:support@madebyckt.com">support@madebyckt.com</a></p>
      <p>We aim to reply within 1–2 working days.</p>
      <p>Made by CKT Ltd · Shropshire, UK · Company No. 17451719</p>
    </div>

    <dl class="faq">
      <dt class="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</dt>
      <dt>I've found a bug in one of your apps — what should I include?</dt>
      <dd>
        The app name and version, your device model and iOS version, and the
        steps that led to the problem. A screenshot helps if it's visual.
        We'll get back to you and let you know if we need anything else.
      </dd>

      <dt>Can I request a feature?</dt>
      <dd>
        Yes — email us with what you're trying to do and why the current
        setup doesn't work for you. We can't promise every request makes it
        in, but we read all of them.
      </dd>

      <dt>Do you take on client or contract work?</dt>
      <dd>
        Sometimes. Tell us a bit about the project via email and we'll let
        you know honestly whether it's a fit for the studio.
      </dd>

      <dt>Is Bike AI available yet?</dt>
      <dd>
        Not yet — it's still in development. Email us if you'd like to be
        told when it's ready for testing.
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
</Layout>
